491
00:26:24,680 --> 00:26:28,640
The distance from point A to point B is identical to the distance from B to A.

492
00:26:28,840 --> 00:26:31,220
And the third is the famous triangle inequality.

493
00:26:31,220 --> 00:26:38,160
The direct path from A to C is always less than or equal to the path from A to B plus B to C.

494
00:26:39,160 --> 00:26:42,500
Taking a detour cannot decrease your total distance.

495
00:26:42,840 --> 00:26:42,960
Right.

